            <sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>14.2</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>
            <sparkle:hardwareRequirements>arm64</sparkle:hardwareRequirements>
            <description><![CDATA[<ul>
<li>The Advanced settings tab is now hidden entirely while you&#x27;re signed out. Its options (auto-title, auto-summary, auto-chapters) need an account to run, so a guest no longer sees toggles that can&#x27;t do anything yet.</li>
<li>Profile menu cleanup: the redundant Home item is gone, Sign out is now the bottom full-width button styled like Sign in, and the account email reads a touch larger.</li>
</ul>
]]></description>
